WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.282
[MUSIC]

00:00:10.282 --> 00:00:14.380
Suppose your
friend is hiding in your house

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:18.950
and a murderer comes to
the door looking for him.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:23.720
The murderer asks you
where your friend is.

00:00:23.735 --> 00:00:27.917
Would it be wrong to
lie to the murderer?

00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:31.533
[MUSIC]

